 "questions": [
  {
   "id": "q1",
   "text": "**tert-Butyl alcohol.** Which functional is the best? Which is the worst? How does HF perform? Are you surprised?"
  },
  {
   "id": "q2",
   "text": "Compare B3LYP/6-31G* with B3LYP/def2-TZVP for the C–O bond. Do you see an improvement? Where do you think it comes from? (Think back to Experiment 6.)"
  },
  {
   "id": "q3",
   "text": "**FeCl.** Which functional performs best? How does HF perform?"
  },
  {
   "id": "q4",
   "text": "Use the NIST panel: what experimental bond enthalpy did you get, how does it differ from the reference electronic energy, and which corrections explain the difference? Can you compare theory and experiment directly?"
  },
  {
   "id": "q5",
   "text": "**Atomization energies.** Which functional is the best? Which is the worst? What causes the failure of HF?"
  },
  {
   "id": "q6",
   "text": "Do you see the same trends for bond dissociation and atomization reactions?"
  },
  {
